     <target value="0"></target>
     <actual value="9">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nine (9) technological gaps were identified in the  fact-finding study that offer opportunity for NL investments:  

Production: 
1. Techniques to avoid the formation of fungi and other diseases in the production field for blueberry, table grape and mandarins. 
2. Pre-cooling installations in or near production fields to pre-cool freshly harvested produce

Off-farm post-harvest handling and processing:  
3. Cold handling in production regions. 
4.. Post-harvest technology to prevent quality decay due to moisture loss and growth of micro-organisms.
5.. Biodegradable packaging improving shelf-life.
6. Automatize post-harvest processing. 
7. Monitoring dry matter.

Transport, logistics : 
8. Cooled transport from production regions to packing houses.
9. Monitor conditions during storage and oversea transport.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
